WEBVTT

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:25.358
This is such an awkward way
to run into you two.

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:27.160
Miss Rose...

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:28.661
You're...

00:00:28.661 --> 00:00:29.896
That uniform...

00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:32.956
No... You're really alive?!

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:37.003
It's me.

00:00:37.003 --> 00:00:39.906
Yes, good shooting.

00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:43.009
Recover Celica's body, will you?

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:47.480
Sorry. I don't have time for a long chat.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.849
See you.

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:52.249
Miss Rose, please wait!

00:00:57.924 --> 00:00:59.585
Miss Rose...

00:01:00.794 --> 00:01:02.785
She's alive...

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:07.700
Rose...

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.302
Why?

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:11.600
What the hell is going on?

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:21.114
You know the continuation of
the fairy tale I've wanted to hear about?

00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:27.781
If it's eternal happiness,
I'll forge it with my own hand

00:01:29.289 --> 00:01:39.265
It's like we were both seeking
a coincidence that was off by a page

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:41.434
And that's how fate brought us together

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:49.576
More than those words
that you once kept to yourself

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:58.518
It's the kindness
that made you keep them to yourself

00:01:58.518 --> 00:02:05.425
That I want to have faith in now

00:02:05.425 --> 00:02:13.166
You know, we'll be living
alongside uncertainty from now on

00:02:13.166 --> 00:02:19.572
We used to have nothing to lose,
but that's not us now

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:27.280
You know the continuation of
the fairy tale I didn't know about before?

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:33.586
If it's eternal happiness,
I'll forge it with my own hand

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:37.545
It's something to build up bit by bit

00:02:43.563 --> 00:02:48.000
"Everyone, Rally Together!"

00:02:52.435 --> 00:02:56.406
Oh, um... We haven't
had dinner yet, right?

00:02:56.406 --> 00:02:58.308
I will go buy something.

00:02:58.308 --> 00:03:00.776
Is there anything you want to eat?

00:03:22.499 --> 00:03:24.768
Rose...

00:03:24.768 --> 00:03:28.238
- Respiration, pulse, blood pressure,
and brain wave levels are normal.
- Crossing the transcend line.

00:03:28.238 --> 00:03:30.974
- Processing level increasing.
- All lines show
compatibility levels of plus-minus 0.4.

00:03:30.974 --> 00:03:33.577
She has passed every stage.

00:03:33.577 --> 00:03:35.412
Patterns show all green.

00:03:35.412 --> 00:03:37.846
She's perfect.

00:03:39.616 --> 00:03:42.319
Rose, you're wonderful.

00:03:42.319 --> 00:03:44.184
You are the absolute best.

00:03:46.590 --> 00:03:48.692
There's something I'd like to show you.

00:03:48.692 --> 00:03:50.284
Come with me.

00:03:51.995 --> 00:03:53.730
What is it that you want to show me?

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:55.391
Where are we going?

00:04:11.581 --> 00:04:17.253
Even top executives don't
have access beyond this point.

00:04:17.253 --> 00:04:19.551
What's in such a place?

00:04:21.291 --> 00:04:25.929
What I want to show you
is behind these doors.

00:04:25.929 --> 00:04:28.832
Behind these doors?

00:04:28.832 --> 00:04:30.567
It's pitch dark!

00:04:30.567 --> 00:04:32.435
What is this place?!

00:04:32.435 --> 00:04:35.205
I have spent many years
building this place.

00:04:35.205 --> 00:04:37.674
But now that I have found
someone of your talent,

00:04:37.674 --> 00:04:40.343
it will at last be able
to fulfill its purpose.

00:04:40.343 --> 00:04:42.045
So, what is it?!

00:04:42.045 --> 00:04:45.014
Or rather, what about lights?!
Aren't there any lights here?!

00:04:50.353 --> 00:04:53.845
Wh-What is this?!

00:04:54.691 --> 00:04:59.963
It is the vessel that will make
our shared dream come true.

00:04:59.963 --> 00:05:03.099
A... ves... sel?

00:05:03.099 --> 00:05:04.862
That's right.

00:05:06.336 --> 00:05:09.533
Now, let us begin our future.

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:33.061
You will catch a cold.

00:05:35.031 --> 00:05:36.800
On to our next story.

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:40.203
We have an update on the murder
at the RUC's Security Department.

00:05:40.203 --> 00:05:47.310
Celica Yayoi, one of the suspects
wanted for the murder of Sylvia Ban,

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:51.214
was shot and killed before dawn
this morning by a SWAT team.

00:05:51.214 --> 00:05:55.952
It is very likely the suspect, Celica,
was in a deranged state of mind

00:05:55.952 --> 00:05:59.422
and she resisted the
SWAT teams attempts...

00:05:59.422 --> 00:06:01.185
Celica...

00:06:02.759 --> 00:06:05.227
What a stupid thing to do!

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:12.402
This is...

00:06:12.402 --> 00:06:13.994
...a video disc!

00:06:19.809 --> 00:06:22.912
You're in there, aren't you?
Integra Martel.

00:06:22.912 --> 00:06:25.582
Accela asked us to come here.

00:06:25.582 --> 00:06:29.780
There's no one here but the two of us,
so could you open the door?

00:06:36.159 --> 00:06:38.194
Don't shoot now.

00:06:38.194 --> 00:06:42.098
This girl asked us to come and get you.

00:06:42.098 --> 00:06:44.259
Please come with us.

00:06:48.638 --> 00:06:50.128
We brought her.

00:06:51.908 --> 00:06:53.739
Integra...

00:06:55.779 --> 00:06:57.480
- Integra!
- Accela!

00:06:57.480 --> 00:07:00.650
I'm so glad! You're all right!

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:02.743
You, too, Integra!

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:06.322
What's going on?

00:07:06.322 --> 00:07:12.862
Oh, um... Miss Accela
helped me out once before,

00:07:12.862 --> 00:07:17.100
so this time, I thought it was
my turn to return the favor.

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:21.137
All right, but hunters
and thieves working together, huh?

00:07:21.137 --> 00:07:23.173
I wonder what the Intelligence Council
would have to say about this.

00:07:23.173 --> 00:07:26.876
Screw the Intelligence Council.

00:07:26.876 --> 00:07:28.545
You're right.

00:07:28.545 --> 00:07:31.748
We heard the gist of
what happened from her.

00:07:31.748 --> 00:07:35.618
We'd like to hear more details from you.

00:07:35.618 --> 00:07:41.724
Why is Rose still alive
and working for the RUC?

00:07:41.724 --> 00:07:47.094
What is this division chief
of yours up to?

00:07:53.503 --> 00:07:57.507
So what it comes down to is...
You don't know anything?

00:07:57.507 --> 00:08:00.176
You don't know why Rose is alive.

00:08:00.176 --> 00:08:03.213
Nor do you know why she came to the RUC.

00:08:03.213 --> 00:08:07.350
Nor do you know what the
division chief is up to. Is that it?

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:09.485
Yes, that's right.

00:08:09.485 --> 00:08:11.120
We're getting nowhere with this.

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:14.457
Come on, you really don't know anything?

00:08:14.457 --> 00:08:17.026
We want information, as well!

00:08:17.026 --> 00:08:19.095
But the data's been tampered with,

00:08:19.095 --> 00:08:21.331
and access to the host computer
is hard to come by.

00:08:21.331 --> 00:08:23.967
All we want to do is prove we were framed!

00:08:23.967 --> 00:08:25.735
Hah! Framed?

00:08:25.735 --> 00:08:27.871
It's all over the news!

00:08:27.871 --> 00:08:31.241
The video of you guys
killing that Silvia girl.

00:08:31.241 --> 00:08:33.776
If you fell for that falsified data,

00:08:33.776 --> 00:08:35.578
I guess thieves aren't very bright.

00:08:35.578 --> 00:08:36.546
What?!

00:08:36.546 --> 00:08:38.014
Stop it!

00:08:38.014 --> 00:08:42.352
Roy, these two probably
haven't told us everything yet.

00:08:42.352 --> 00:08:45.555
They're likely hiding information
that we're unaware of.

00:08:45.555 --> 00:08:46.322
Yeah.

00:08:46.322 --> 00:08:50.360
At any rate, if we could
just talk with Rose...

00:08:50.360 --> 00:08:51.761
Yeah.

00:08:51.761 --> 00:08:53.830
The entire series of events

00:08:53.830 --> 00:08:58.468
appears to have begun
when Rose showed up at the RUC.

00:08:58.468 --> 00:09:01.767
Rose might hold some kind of key to this.

00:09:04.874 --> 00:09:06.342
Agreed.

00:09:06.342 --> 00:09:08.645
We can start by trying that angle first.

00:09:08.645 --> 00:09:11.014
So, what do we do about these two?

00:09:11.014 --> 00:09:14.050
Oh, uh, um, Mr. Roy...

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:16.419
- Do whatever you want.
- What?

00:09:16.419 --> 00:09:17.921
I'll leave them to you.

00:09:17.921 --> 00:09:19.088
Oh...

00:09:19.088 --> 00:09:21.591
Ms. Miranda!

00:09:21.591 --> 00:09:24.661
- Then, why don't we put them
in the empty room downstairs?
- J-Just a minute...

00:09:24.661 --> 00:09:27.830
Hey! You're going to harbor criminals?

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:30.500
You guys are pretty much
in the same boat, too.

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:32.902
Hey! Don't lump us together with them!

00:09:32.902 --> 00:09:36.105
- Say, I'm getting hungry, Solty.
- Damn brat!

00:09:36.105 --> 00:09:39.542
- Oh, that reminds me.
We haven't had dinner yet.
- You're just gonna leave it at that?!

00:09:39.542 --> 00:09:42.745
I will get it ready right away,
so please hold on.

00:09:42.745 --> 00:09:43.846
Make it quick, okay?

00:09:43.846 --> 00:09:45.048
Oh, Kasha!

00:09:45.048 --> 00:09:47.150
Um, I'll help, too.

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:49.552
Wait a minute, Accela!

00:09:49.552 --> 00:09:52.488
Okay! I could use the help!

00:09:52.488 --> 00:09:53.523
Okay!

00:09:53.523 --> 00:09:54.854
Hold on...

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:58.427
Honestly...

00:10:05.468 --> 00:10:07.837
This is so great, Miss Accela.

00:10:07.837 --> 00:10:09.906
Y-Yes...

00:10:09.906 --> 00:10:12.208
Thank you.

00:10:12.208 --> 00:10:13.977
It was nothing!

00:10:13.977 --> 00:10:15.578
Oh, you can't do that.

00:10:15.578 --> 00:10:17.814
You have to cut them smaller.

00:10:17.814 --> 00:10:19.849
What? Is that right?

00:10:19.849 --> 00:10:23.686
Yes. If they're too big,
they won't cook through.

00:10:23.686 --> 00:10:25.888
If they do not cook through...

00:10:25.888 --> 00:10:28.524
- Say...
- Well...

00:10:28.524 --> 00:10:32.895
There's something I want to ask you.

00:10:32.895 --> 00:10:35.765
I see. So this is about Silvia?

00:10:35.765 --> 00:10:38.835
I heard most of the story
from Accela earlier, but...

00:10:38.835 --> 00:10:41.738
You were friends, weren't you?

00:10:41.738 --> 00:10:42.939
Yes.

00:10:42.939 --> 00:10:45.999
Since that one time, we used
to get together every so often.

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:51.614
She was like a little kid,
even though she was a grown-up,

00:10:51.614 --> 00:10:56.085
but when we'd meet,
she'd treat me to ice cream a lot.

00:10:56.085 --> 00:10:57.620
Kasha...

00:10:57.620 --> 00:10:59.679
She was nice person...

00:11:01.290 --> 00:11:04.527
I will avenge her.

00:11:04.527 --> 00:11:08.131
In the case of the murder
at the RUC's Security Department,

00:11:08.131 --> 00:11:11.567
the fact the chief investigator was
previously the suspects' superior...

00:11:11.567 --> 00:11:14.400
...is being criticized by some.
- Ashley...

00:11:23.446 --> 00:11:27.473
It seems I cannot remain
an idle spectator any longer.

00:11:35.792 --> 00:11:39.062
I love this city.

00:11:39.062 --> 00:11:43.199
And at the same time,
I despise it, as well.

00:11:43.199 --> 00:11:46.566
I will crush any element
that gets in the way of my plan!

00:11:59.449 --> 00:12:01.517
What's the matter with you people?!

00:12:01.517 --> 00:12:03.352
You keep hounding us
for interviews and reports!

00:12:03.352 --> 00:12:06.722
- My Celica would never do such a thing!
- I'm sorry, Auntie.

00:12:06.722 --> 00:12:09.525
Are you... Integra?

00:12:09.525 --> 00:12:10.927
It's you, isn't it, Integra?!

00:12:10.927 --> 00:12:13.763
Why? Why is all this happening?!

00:12:13.763 --> 00:12:18.598
Is she still troubled about
the fact she alone was adopted?

00:12:21.204 --> 00:12:22.762
I'm so sorry.

00:12:25.374 --> 00:12:26.671
Yes?

00:12:28.644 --> 00:12:29.879
Come.

00:12:29.879 --> 00:12:31.779
I have something to show you.

00:12:36.319 --> 00:12:37.487
Okay...

00:12:37.487 --> 00:12:39.889
Is this recording?

00:12:39.889 --> 00:12:43.826
It's recording, right? The light's on.

00:12:43.826 --> 00:12:45.895
Well, let me see...

00:12:45.895 --> 00:12:50.466
If I tried to write a letter,
I feel like it might get longwinded,

00:12:50.466 --> 00:12:53.636
and it's troublesome to put it in writing,
so I'll do it this way.

00:12:53.636 --> 00:12:56.772
I actually feel more embarrassed
doing it this way,

00:12:56.772 --> 00:12:59.909
but it's easier,
so I'll just go with it.

00:12:59.909 --> 00:13:01.277
Let's see...

00:13:01.277 --> 00:13:03.779
Integra...

00:13:03.779 --> 00:13:07.083
I'm sorry for all the trouble I caused.

00:13:07.083 --> 00:13:10.419
With things ending up
this way somehow and...

00:13:10.419 --> 00:13:14.357
Would you listen to me?!
It sounds like my last words!

00:13:14.357 --> 00:13:19.896
- Oh, and I feel bad asking this, but I
need a little favor from you, Accela.
- Celica...

00:13:19.896 --> 00:13:21.063
lf...

00:13:21.063 --> 00:13:25.434
If anything were to...
were to happen to me,

00:13:25.434 --> 00:13:30.873
would you mind going once a year
to tidy up my older sister's grave?

00:13:30.873 --> 00:13:34.510
I'd feel weird asking
my current parents to do that.

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:35.645
Sorry...

00:13:35.645 --> 00:13:37.346
I'm depending on you, okay?

00:13:37.346 --> 00:13:40.383
And also... Um...

00:13:40.383 --> 00:13:42.318
No, never mind...

00:13:42.318 --> 00:13:45.354
That's all. Thanks!

00:13:45.354 --> 00:13:47.982
Well... Bye-bye.

00:13:58.267 --> 00:14:00.132
Celica...

00:14:45.381 --> 00:14:46.746
Rose!

00:14:52.722 --> 00:14:56.125
Tell me, what do you want to do?

00:14:56.125 --> 00:14:58.427
What would you like me to do?

00:14:58.427 --> 00:15:01.760
It's not fair to answer
a question with a question.

00:15:03.633 --> 00:15:06.836
You have something in mind, don't you?

00:15:06.836 --> 00:15:08.104
Yes.

00:15:08.104 --> 00:15:11.274
You believe in yourself, don't you?

00:15:11.274 --> 00:15:12.441
Yes.

00:15:12.441 --> 00:15:16.400
Then, why do look so uncertain?

00:15:18.014 --> 00:15:21.317
People all make mistakes.

00:15:21.317 --> 00:15:24.287
People and machines both make mistakes.

00:15:24.287 --> 00:15:28.924
What's important is to
not repeat those mistakes.

00:15:28.924 --> 00:15:33.129
And to that end, you have to
use your abilities to the fullest,

00:15:33.129 --> 00:15:35.498
and work hard so that you have no regrets.

00:15:35.498 --> 00:15:38.490
If you do that, you can start your future.

00:15:40.269 --> 00:15:41.904
Let's go.

00:15:41.904 --> 00:15:42.805
Yes.

00:15:42.805 --> 00:15:44.206
To the future.

00:15:44.206 --> 00:15:45.341
Yes.

00:15:45.341 --> 00:15:46.865
Together.

00:16:04.794 --> 00:16:06.395
Take call.

00:16:06.395 --> 00:16:07.630
What is it?

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:10.066
I apologize for disturbing you,
Division Chief,

00:16:10.066 --> 00:16:12.330
but we have a situation in the lobby.

00:16:13.736 --> 00:16:15.504
Hey, let go!

00:16:15.504 --> 00:16:17.306
Where do you think we are?!

00:16:17.306 --> 00:16:18.507
Listen to what I have to say!

00:16:18.507 --> 00:16:20.242
I said, stop it!

00:16:20.242 --> 00:16:21.544
You're making a scene!

00:16:21.544 --> 00:16:22.645
Rose!

00:16:22.645 --> 00:16:24.647
You said so yourself!

00:16:24.647 --> 00:16:28.517
As long as I'm alive,
you don't care what I do!

00:16:28.517 --> 00:16:30.353
I'm alive, so what's the problem?

00:16:30.353 --> 00:16:32.955
All right, that's it. We're done talking.

00:16:32.955 --> 00:16:34.123
We're not done!

00:16:34.123 --> 00:16:36.892
Talk to me!

00:16:36.892 --> 00:16:39.095
Well, I have work to do.

00:16:39.095 --> 00:16:41.063
Hey!

00:16:41.063 --> 00:16:44.900
Excuse me. This is a place of business.

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:47.803
Please refrain from such behavior.

00:16:47.803 --> 00:16:49.705
Damn!

00:16:49.705 --> 00:16:51.707
Who the hell are you?!

00:16:51.707 --> 00:16:54.643
What is your relationship
to Rose Anderson?

00:16:54.643 --> 00:16:56.479
I asked you who you were.

00:16:56.479 --> 00:16:58.214
Forgive me.

00:16:58.214 --> 00:17:03.619
I am her superior and the
division chief of RUC Security.

00:17:03.619 --> 00:17:07.056
My name is Ashley Lynx.

00:17:07.056 --> 00:17:09.892
So you're...

00:17:09.892 --> 00:17:14.430
If you don't mind,
won't you tell me about it?

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:17.032
Excuse me.

00:17:17.032 --> 00:17:19.668
The tea leaves are grown by our company.

00:17:19.668 --> 00:17:22.571
Very fragrant and the flavor
isn't bad, either.

00:17:22.571 --> 00:17:24.835
It's a favorite of mine.

00:17:26.742 --> 00:17:28.544
Give Rose back.

00:17:28.544 --> 00:17:29.378
I beg your pardon?

00:17:29.378 --> 00:17:31.280
She's my daughter.

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:33.849
I'm taking her home with me,
so call her here.

00:17:33.849 --> 00:17:38.053
Ah, it seems the tea is not to your liking.

00:17:38.053 --> 00:17:39.555
Would you prefer something else?

00:17:39.555 --> 00:17:42.458
Never mind! Hurry up and call her here!

00:17:42.458 --> 00:17:45.261
You needn't yell. I can hear you.

00:17:45.261 --> 00:17:46.829
Then make it quick.

00:17:46.829 --> 00:17:48.831
I'm afraid I can't do that.

00:17:48.831 --> 00:17:51.066
She is working right now.

00:17:51.066 --> 00:17:54.297
I will hear what you have to say.

00:17:57.873 --> 00:17:59.241
Where are you going?

00:17:59.241 --> 00:18:02.077
If you won't call her,
I'll go there myself.

00:18:02.077 --> 00:18:05.648
We cannot have outsiders
roaming about the company.

00:18:05.648 --> 00:18:09.118
I can't let Rose work under a guy like you.

00:18:09.118 --> 00:18:13.589
It appears you loath me quite thoroughly.

00:18:13.589 --> 00:18:18.227
Not under a guy like you, who throws
his subordinates to the wolves.

00:18:18.227 --> 00:18:20.863
What is that supposed to mean?

00:18:20.863 --> 00:18:26.869
Perhaps you know something
about my former subordinates?

00:18:26.869 --> 00:18:30.306
I would be most grateful for
any information you might have.

00:18:30.306 --> 00:18:33.709
It's a citizen's duty to
cooperate with an investigation.

00:18:33.709 --> 00:18:35.277
I don't know anything.

00:18:35.277 --> 00:18:36.412
Really?

00:18:36.412 --> 00:18:39.014
Even if I did, I have
no intention of telling you.

00:18:39.014 --> 00:18:40.572
Why is that?

00:18:43.853 --> 00:18:46.889
Because I hate you.

00:18:46.889 --> 00:18:49.449
I find you unpleasant, as well.

00:18:52.361 --> 00:18:54.430
Mr. Roy Revant...

00:18:54.430 --> 00:18:59.768
The RUC controls the government
and economy of this city.

00:18:59.768 --> 00:19:01.136
What of it?

00:19:01.136 --> 00:19:02.571
If you don't mind your own business,

00:19:02.571 --> 00:19:07.576
not only you, but those
around you, might get hurt.

00:19:07.576 --> 00:19:08.577
You!

00:19:08.577 --> 00:19:12.615
Do you understand what I am saying?

00:19:12.615 --> 00:19:14.083
Are you threatening me?

00:19:14.083 --> 00:19:16.285
That depends on you.

00:19:16.285 --> 00:19:19.083
Please take your leave via the back exit.

00:19:20.055 --> 00:19:22.523
Do you need someone
to show you the way?

00:20:07.670 --> 00:20:11.504
Please leave your message after the beep.

00:20:13.475 --> 00:20:15.177
Roy Revant,

00:20:15.177 --> 00:20:16.879
this is Joseph.

00:20:16.879 --> 00:20:20.849
I took the liberty of
looking up your number.

00:20:20.849 --> 00:20:23.919
- Some people paid me a visit
just a short while ago.
- This voice...

00:20:23.919 --> 00:20:24.954
I've heard it before.

00:20:24.954 --> 00:20:28.557
He... Ashley is serious.

00:20:28.557 --> 00:20:30.559
Another failure...

00:20:30.559 --> 00:20:32.795
After all our efforts, still no success?!

00:20:32.795 --> 00:20:35.197
We can't control the fatality rate,
no matter what we do!

00:20:35.197 --> 00:20:39.501
Maybe our method of augmenting
the genes was wrong?

00:20:39.501 --> 00:20:41.526
Are you serious, Ashley?!

00:20:43.539 --> 00:20:46.675
The division chief was there!

00:20:46.675 --> 00:20:49.445
I've shipped a package to you.

00:20:49.445 --> 00:20:51.880
I think you'll find it useful.

00:20:51.880 --> 00:20:54.283
And give my regards to that girl as well.

00:20:54.283 --> 00:20:56.513
Hello? Hello?!

00:21:01.557 --> 00:21:03.491
What is the matter?

00:21:05.227 --> 00:21:06.295
Tell me!

00:21:06.295 --> 00:21:07.730
Y-Yes?

00:21:07.730 --> 00:21:10.099
Do you know a man named Joseph?

00:21:10.099 --> 00:21:12.901
What? Uh, did something
happen to Joseph?

00:21:12.901 --> 00:21:14.603
Tell me where he is!

00:21:14.603 --> 00:21:15.763
Please!

00:21:20.909 --> 00:21:24.003
Twelve years have
already passed since then.

00:21:25.581 --> 00:21:31.019
But this time for sure,
I will come for you, Illumina.

00:21:52.571 --> 00:21:57.342
On a clear day in the park

00:21:57.342 --> 00:22:00.279
Looking up at the sky

00:22:00.279 --> 00:22:08.584
There was a tiny little cloud
that almost vanished

00:22:11.523 --> 00:22:16.295
Letting the wind take us where it will

00:22:16.295 --> 00:22:19.231
We live freely

00:22:19.231 --> 00:22:25.170
We make our way,
walking a little at a time

00:22:27.272 --> 00:22:29.968
We're the same

00:22:32.044 --> 00:22:36.815
This precious time

00:22:36.815 --> 00:22:40.486
Each time we meet

00:22:40.486 --> 00:22:50.028
This feeling of not being alone
turns into kindness

00:22:50.028 --> 00:22:56.702
I can turn it into
the courage to believe in someone

00:22:56.702 --> 00:23:08.705
And surely, before I vanish
into the far reaches of that sky...

00:23:15.487 --> 00:23:18.290
What in the world is going on, Miss Rose?

00:23:18.290 --> 00:23:20.292
That's my business.

00:23:20.292 --> 00:23:23.262
Next time, "Catastrophe Calls".

00:23:23.262 --> 00:23:25.130
You will come back, right?
